    <!--$--><!--html--><!--head-->
    <div
      style="display:none;overflow:hidden;line-height:1px;opacity:0;max-height:0;max-width:0">
      We fixed QuickCalAI - and added something you are going to love
      <div>
         ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿
      </div>
    </div>
    <!--body-->
    <table
      align="center"
      width="100%"
      border="0"
      cellpadding="0"
      cellspacing="0"
      role="presentation"
      style="max-width:600px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;background-color:rgb(22,22,22);border-radius:0.75rem;overflow:hidden">
      <tbody>
        <tr style="width:100%">
          <td>
            <table
              align="center"
              width="100%"
              border="0"
              cellpadding="0"
              cellspacing="0"
              role="presentation"
              style="background-color:rgb(194,51,38);padding-left:2rem;padding-right:2rem;padding-top:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.5rem">
              <tbody>
                <tr>
                  <td>
                    <p
                      style="color:rgb(255,255,255);font-size:1.5rem;line-height:2rem;font-weight:700;margin:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px">
                      QuickCalAI
                    </p>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
            <table
              align="center"
              width="100%"
              border="0"
              cellpadding="0"
              cellspacing="0"
              role="presentation"
              style="padding-left:2rem;padding-right:2rem;padding-top:2rem;padding-bottom:2rem">
              <tbody>
                <tr>
                  <td>
                    <p
                      style="color:rgb(239,239,239);font-size:1.25rem;line-height:1.75rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:1rem;margin-top:16px">
                      We owe you an apology<!-- -->, John
                    </p>
                    <p
                      style="color:rgb(136,136,136);font-size:1rem;line-height:1.625;margin-bottom:1rem;margin-top:16px">
                      A little while ago, QuickCalAI was in a rough state.
                      Uploads were failing, webhooks were breaking, and frankly,
                      the experience was not what we promised. If you tried the
                      app back then and it did not work - that was on us, not
                      you.
                    </p>
                    <p
                      style="color:rgb(136,136,136);font-size:1rem;line-height:1.625;margin-bottom:1.5rem;margin-top:16px">
                      The good news? We have rebuilt the core from the ground
                      up. Here is what is different now:
                    </p>
                    <table
                      align="center"
                      width="100%"
                      border="0"
                      cellpadding="0"
                      cellspacing="0"
                      role="presentation"
                      class="space-y-3"
                      style="background-color:rgb(26,26,26);border-radius:0.5rem;padding:1.25rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem">
                      <tbody>
                        <tr>
                          <td>
                            <p
                              style="color:rgb(239,239,239);font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.625;margin:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px">
                              <span style="color:rgb(194,51,38);font-weight:700"
                                >Fixed:</span
                              >
                              Uploads no longer hang or timeout
                            </p>
                            <p
                              style="color:rgb(239,239,239);font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.625;margin:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px">
                              <span style="color:rgb(194,51,38);font-weight:700"
                                >Fixed:</span
                              >
                              Premium status now syncs correctly
                            </p>
                            <p
                              style="color:rgb(239,239,239);font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.625;margin:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px">
                              <span style="color:rgb(194,51,38);font-weight:700"
                                >New:</span
                              >
                              Brand-new uploader with real-time progress and
                              step-by-step status
                            </p>
                            <p
                              style="color:rgb(239,239,239);font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.625;margin:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px">
                              <span style="color:rgb(194,51,38);font-weight:700"
                                >New:</span
                              >
                              Shareable preview pages - send a link instead of a
                              file
                            </p>
                            <p
                              style="color:rgb(239,239,239);font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.625;margin:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px">
                              <span style="color:rgb(194,51,38);font-weight:700"
                                >New:</span
                              >
                              Manual event creation for one-off entries
                            </p>
                          </td>
                        </tr>
                      </tbody>
                    </table>
                    <p
                      style="color:rgb(136,136,136);font-size:1rem;line-height:1.625;margin-bottom:1.5rem;margin-top:16px">
                      We would love for you to give QuickCalAI another shot.
                      Upload a schedule and see the difference for yourself.
                    </p>
                    <a
                      href="https://quickcal.ai/dashboard"
                      style="background-color:rgb(194,51,38);color:rgb(255,255,255);font-weight:700;padding-left:1.5rem;padding-right:1.5rem;padding-top:0.75rem;padding-bottom:0.75rem;border-radius:0.5rem;text-align:center;display:block;box-sizing:border-box;line-height:100%;text-decoration:none;max-width:100%;mso-padding-alt:0px;padding:12px 24px 12px 24px"
                      target="_blank"
                      ><span
                        ><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:400%;mso-text-raise:18" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;</i><![endif]--></span
                      ><span
                        style="max-width:100%;display:inline-block;line-height:120%;mso-padding-alt:0px;mso-text-raise:9px"
                        >Try QuickCalAI Again</span
                      ><span
                        ><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:400%" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></span
                      ></a
                    >
                    <p
                      style="color:rgb(136,136,136);font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.25rem;margin-top:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0px">
                      If you have any feedback or just want to vent about the
                      old version, hit reply - we are listening.
                    </p>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
            <table
              align="center"
              width="100%"
              border="0"
              cellpadding="0"
              cellspacing="0"
              role="presentation"
              style="padding-left:2rem;padding-right:2rem;padding-top:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.5rem;border-top-width:1px;border-color:rgb(51,51,51)">
              <tbody>
                <tr>
                  <td>
                    <p
                      style="color:rgb(102,102,102);font-size:0.75rem;line-height:1rem;text-align:center;margin:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px">
                      QuickCalAI · Making schedule sharing effortless
                    </p>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <!--/$-->
  </body>
</html>
