rem;line-height:1.625;margin:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px"><span style="color:rgb(194,51,38);font-weight:700">New:</span> Shareable preview pages - send a link instead of a file</p><p style="color:rgb(239,239,239);font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.625;margin:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px"><span style="color:rgb(194,51,38);font-weight:700">New:</span> Manual event creation for one-off entries</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="color:rgb(136,136,136);font-size:1rem;line-height:1.625;margin-bottom:1.5rem;margin-top:16px">We would love for you to give QuickCalAI another shot. Upload a schedule and see the difference for yourself.</p><a href="https://quickcal.ai/dashboard" style="background-color:rgb(194,51,38);color:rgb(255,255,255);font-weight:700;padding-left:1.5rem;padding-right:1.5rem;padding-top:0.75rem;padding-bottom:0.75rem;border-radius:0.5rem;text-align:center;display:block;box-sizing:border-box;line-height:100%;text-decoration:none;max-width:100%;mso-padding-alt:0px;padding:12px 24px 12px 24px" target="_blank"><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:400%;mso-text-raise:18" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;</i><![endif]--></span><span style="max-width:100%;display:inline-block;line-height:120%;mso-padding-alt:0px;mso-text-raise:9px">Try QuickCalAI Again</span><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:400%" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></span></a><p style="color:rgb(136,136,136);font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.25rem;margin-top:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0px">If you have any feedback or just want to vent about the old version, hit reply - we are listening.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="padding-left:2rem;padding-right:2rem;padding-top:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.5rem;border-top-width:1px;border-color:rgb(51,51,51)"><tbody><tr><td><p style="color:rgb(102,102,102);fon